        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;%% Presentation-friendly idempotency overview for Video 2, Slide 7.\n%% Detailed concurrency/unique-constraint behavior remains in idempotency-generic.mmd.\nflowchart LR\n    A[Request&lt;br/&gt;Idempotency-Key: K] --&gt; B{Redis lookup}\n\n    B --&gt;|Hit| C{Same payload?}\n    C --&gt;|Yes| D[Replay previous result&lt;br/&gt;No new side effect]\n    C --&gt;|No| E[409 Conflict&lt;br/&gt;Idempotency key reused]\n\n    B --&gt;|Miss| F{Database fallback}\n    F --&gt;|Existing + same payload| D\n    F --&gt;|Existing + different payload| E\n    F --&gt;|No existing request| G[Process normally]\n\n    G --&gt; H[Persist result]\n    H --&gt; I[Cache response in Redis]\n    I --&gt; J[Return result]\n\n    classDef entry fill:#E8F0FE,stroke:#3B6EA8,stroke-width:2px,color:#172B4D;\n    classDef decision fill:#FFF4CC,stroke:#B58B00,stroke-width:2px,color:#3D3200;\n    classDef success fill:#E6F4EA,stroke:#2E7D32,stroke-width:2px,color:#173A1A;\n    classDef conflict fill:#FDECEC,stroke:#C62828,stroke-width:2px,color:#5A1717;\n    classDef process fill:#F3F4F6,stroke:#6B7280,stroke-width:2px,color:#1F2937;\n\n    class A entry;\n    class B,C,F decision;\n    class D,J success;\n    class E conflict;\n    class G,H,I process;\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null,&#xa;  &quot;version&quot;: &quot;12&quot;&#xa;}" id="Bspnvo7wXiG6xVa4hbxi-1">
